  << /ActualText (I\031m moderately confident about this\056\056\056 \n\nAvailable industry data supports beauty as a stronger adjacency\054 based on DTC brand transitions and margin trends\056 \n\nHowever\054 outcome variance is high \024 especially in supply chain and regulatory complexity\056 Recommend time\055boxed pilots to validate consumer alignment before deeper investment\056)
